## Phase 2 — Backend: Seed Script (10,000 Employees)

**Commit:** `feat(backend): seed 10,000 employees with faker and exchange rate table`

- [x] Install `@faker-js/faker`
- [x] Create `backend/prisma/seed.ts`:
  - Seed `ExchangeRate` table by fetching daily rates from `fawazahmed0/exchange-api`
  - Generate 10,000 employees with realistic distribution:
    - Countries: US 40%, IN 30%, UK 20%, DE 10%
    - Departments: Engineering, Sales, Marketing, HR, Finance, Operations, Product
