    - Unique emails, human-readable `EMP-XXXXX` IDs, realistic hire dates
  - Use `prisma.createMany` with batching for performance
- [x] Add `"prisma": { "seed": "ts-node prisma/seed.ts" }` to `package.json`
- [x] Run seed and verify 10,000 records in DB
- [x] Add `backend/prisma/seed.ts` to git

